{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの友達はルフィの帽子をかぶって、日本変形菌類図鑑という本を読んでます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/0934700/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままと難波行ってきたの図です！木にスズメがいっぱいとまってたので撮ってもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここどこかわかるかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で着る服などを買いましたえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとキューズモールに友達としゃぶしゃぶ食べ放題いって楽しかった。安いのにめっちゃ美味しかったゼア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り際に誕生日の色紙をくれました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お、お、遅いけどもありがとう嬉しいヽ(｡>▽<｡)ﾉ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいお好み焼きも食べれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままとカラオケも行った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エナジー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャージ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソーラービーム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ううううう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弱点！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの弱点って何ですか？ぜひ教えてたも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/0934700/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真がないから、前の西野"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定期入れを落としたことに気づかず電話で話し続けていた人がいたので拾って渡しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18になって気付いた、親切をする人もされる人もいい気分になれますね(　・´ｰ・｀)よきかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らない人に礼儀としての挨拶や笑顔をできるようになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょこぴょこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弱点はなんですか(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}